# Scratch: dot-prefixed one-shot scripts and commit-message files.
# Exact names were listed four times and failed four times (each commit added
# a *new* .mN.txt); the pattern is the fix. Dot-prefix matters: the repo's
# real sources live under scripts/*.mjs with no leading dot.
.*.mjs
.*.txt
scratch-*
.msg*.txt
.cm.txt
.m*.txt
